<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA BEAT NORTHERN COUNTIES 64-16.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA BEAT NORTHERN COUNTIES 64-16.</headline>
<dateline>HUDDERSFIELD, England 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat</p>
<p>Northern Counties 64-16 (halftime 38-13) in their rugby union</p>
<p>tour match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Northern Counties - Tries: Monighan. Conversions: Stabler.</p>
<p>Penalties: Stabler 3.</p>
<p>Argentina - Tries: Bouza 2, Solari 2, Soler 2, Giannantonio,</p>
<p>Grau, Simone, Viel. Conversions: Cilley 7.</p>
</text>
